 "notes": [
  "The published title ends in a masked profanity ('@#$%'), so this page is titled Matt Wehner DS; the published title is not shown on the page. His later Dark post (DeckTech 18858) is Matt Wehner DS 2.",
  "Starting cards as posted under 'Starting': No Money, No Parts, No Deal! / You're A Slave? (posted 'Watto Obj.'), Tatooine: Watto's Junkyard, Tatooine: Mos Espa, Prepared Defenses, Imperial Arrest Order & Secret Plans, There Is No Try & Oppressive Enforcement and Power Of The Hutt; these count toward the 60.",
  "Section headers say Interrupts (10) and Effects (9), but the lists hold 11 interrupts and 8 effects; the total is 60 as published.",
  "Posted 'Tatooine' dested the Dark Premiere system Tatooine (the post does not say which printing); Watto's Junkyard, Mos Espa and Mos Espa Docking Bay dested the Dark sites; 'Tat. Jabba's Palace' dested the Dark Jabba's Palace site.",
  "Posted 'Dengar w/BoomStick' dested Dengar With Blaster Carbine; 'IGGY w/Riot Gun' dested IG-88 With Riot Gun; '4LOM w/Boomstick' dested 4-LOM With Concussion Rifle; 'U3P0' dested U-3PO (Yoo-Threepio); 'Darth Maul(Tat)' dested Darth Maul (Tatooine); 'Executor (Dag.)' dested Executor (Dagobah).",
  "Posted 'Weapon Lev' dested the Dark Weapon Levitation (Cloud City); 'Come Here You Big Coward' dested the Special Edition Effect (the Defensive Shield version is from Reflections III, after this post); 'Mara's Stick' dested Mara Jade's Lightsaber; 'Mara Jade' dested Mara Jade, The Emperor's Hand."
 ],
